{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22677","headline":"酬和元九东川路诗十二首 江楼月 · 白居易","name":"酬和元九东川路诗十二首 江楼月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉陵江曲曲江池，明月虽同人别离。\n一宵光景潜相忆，两地阴晴远不知。\n谁料江边怀我夜，正当池畔望君时。\n今朝共语方同悔，不解多情先寄诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}